  "bio": "Luna Soul Ink is an illustrative tattoo artist based in Berlin, Germany, known for creating tattoos with intention and a touch of ceremony. Luna's professionalism is evident in their unique approach, blending art with a meaningful experience to provide clients with more than just a tattoo, but a personal story etched in ink. With meticulous attention to detail, Luna ensures each piece is a bespoke work of art, earning them recognition within the Berlin tattoo community.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Berlin, Berlin, Germany\n\nLLUNA with 2L\n•: 𝑪𝒉𝒂𝒏𝒏𝒆𝒍𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝒚𝒐𝒖𝒓 𝒗𝒊𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒔:•\n#1000paintingstomywedding @llunasoul.art\nCat/Esp/Eng\n📥 aloha@llunasoul.com",
